<h2 id="toc7"><span><span style="font-size:80%;">Bonds</span></span></h2>
<table class="wiki-content-table">
<tr>
<th>d4</th>
<th>Bond</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td>The job is all that matters. I will see it through.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td>My orders are important, but my comrades are worth more than anything. I would die for them.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>3</td>
<td>Everything I've done, I've done to protect someone close to me.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>4</td>
<td>If the empire falls, all of civilization falls with it. I will hold back the chaos and barbarism at any cost.</td>
</tr>
</table>
